WEBVTT

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.510
Show us your foot, Shigeno-kun.

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:53.870
Huh?

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:54.730
What for?

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:57.060
There's no use hiding it.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:01.190
We can tell just by looking that the condition of your foot is bad.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:06.520
We can't turn a blind eye and let you continue to play in this state.

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:13.280
We have the responsibility to order you to substitute players if the doctor thinks it's serious.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.000
C-Change!?

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.990
What's so funny!?

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.670
Quit kidding around.

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:31.390
We have no replacement pitchers... not even a filler.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:37.060
Or are you telling us to give up?

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.270
That's right.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:43.730
We feel sorry for you, but depending on the condition of your foot, we may have no other choice.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.430
Now show us your foot.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.740
That's not possible.

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.200
I'll never show it to you.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.410
Shigeno.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.650
Isn't this enough?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.140
What!?

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.020
It's enough.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.920
You've fought hard enough.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.880
We have no chance of winning in extra innings.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.550
Our opponent is the impregnable Mayumura, who's not fatigued in the least.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:19.600
We probably won't be able to score, let alone get a runner out-

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.600
You!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.540
We have no chance of winning!?

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.560
Don't give up when we've come this far!

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.280
Who cares about Mayumura!

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.600
I can't catch it anymore.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:41.750
I don't want to catch your dying pitches from the mound anymore.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.210
Let's give up, Shigeno.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.380
Sorry, Tashiro,

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:00.310
for making you worry about my foot like that.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.700
But,

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.860
I still haven't taken responsibility.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.680
I...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:13.240
still haven't taken responsibility for my selfish desire to want to defeat Kaido.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:15.450
R-Responsibility!?

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.260
Yeah.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:22.250
For you guys, I made you follow me; and for the guys at Kaido,

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.920
I can't fulfill my responsibility by giving up or letting it end in a draw.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:33.460
That's why as long as my pitches reach your glove, there's no way I'll give up.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.890
I have to close this.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:42.900
Even if it means we'll be left utterly defeated.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.020
Umpire.

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:52.990
Could you please respect this boy's desire?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:57.490
If it becomes really dangerous, I will make him give up.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.520
Top of the tenth inning: leading off for Seishuu High School... 

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.700
Batting fourth: catcher, Tashiro-kun.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:19.220
Play!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.680
<i>I don't understand.</i>

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.890
<i>I don't understand, Shigeno!</i>

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.460
Strike!

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.150
<i>What's this about responsibility!?</i>

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:37.330
<i>Why do you continue when you know we'll be utterly defeated by Mayumura!?</i>

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.540
Strike!

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:43.960
<i>I-I grazed it!</i>

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.460
<i>I-I grazed it!</i>

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:48.420
<i>I grazed Mayumura's pitch!</i>

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.670
Ball!

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.520
<i>Oh no...</i>

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.220
<i>What am I thinking about in the batter's box?</i>

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:05.720
<i>What difference does it make if I'm able to see what Shigeno is carrying on his shoulder!?</i>

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.940
<i>I already started to give up on this game!</i>

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:10.900
<i>That's right.</i>

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.870
<i>We don't fight because there's something in the future.</i>

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:19.110
<i>We fight because there's probably an enormous mountain in front of us now!</i>

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:29.950
Out!

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:32.250
You can hit it.

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:33.630
We can hit it!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.230
Don't give up!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.090
The game isn't over yet!

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.340
Yeah!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.650
All right! 

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:28.100
Top of the twelfth inning: leading off for Seishuu High School... 

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.060
Batting first: right fielder, Shimizu-kun.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:35.280
It was like this back then too, wasn't it?

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:39.490
That game we won against the Yokohama Littles...

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:45.950
Honda-kun was also shattered back then,
but he never left the mound.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:54.200
However tough the situation was, Honda-kun was shining till the end, believing in victory.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:08:00.050
Even though it broke his shoulder in the end...

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.000
Shimizu-san?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.110
You want something to drink?

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.250
I'll go buy some juice or something.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:08.950
Huh?

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.980
But Honda-kun is almost up to bat.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.100
Shimizu-san.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:28.090
Did you come to cheer him on?

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.250
Y-Yes.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:34.530
What's the matter, Mrs. Honda? Why are you down here?

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:36.710
Yes.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.960
I came here to cheer him on, but...

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.710
I couldn't stand watching him.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:49.260
I wonder why this always happens to him.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:52.930
I'm... 

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.800
I'm the same, 

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.150
Mother.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:01.160
How many extra innings do they have?

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:04.580
U-Um... I think it was up to fifteen innings.

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.950
And if they can't settle the game, they will probably have a rematch.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:09.120
I see.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.590
I know I shouldn't be thinking this, but...

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.090
I wish he could just lose.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:21.300
I just don't want him to go through that misfortune again.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.330
It'll be okay.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.830
Because he's always... 

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.430
He's always choosing the option he won't regret!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.940
I'll be going back.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.570
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.270
<i>It's not misfortune.</i>

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:50.580
Batting third: pitcher, Shigeno-kun.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.200
Play!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.410
<i>What's the point if I turn my eyes away!?</i>

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:59.130
<i>I'll watch your way of life with my own two eyes, Honda!</i>

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:26.200
Run, Honda! 

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.210
S-Safe!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.450
Safe!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.510
This is a free fansub.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.510
Not for sale or rent.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.480
Strike!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.040
Strike!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:56.890
Batter out!

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.930
Three outs! Change!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.490
I-I'm sorry, Shigeno.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.550
Yeah...

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:15.160
Don't worry about it.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:16.940
Here.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.080
Shigeno-senpai. Your helmet.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.250
H-Huh? Yeah...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.760
Shigeno...

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.640
Let's go for it this inning!

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:41.360
From the looks of his running, he's at his limit now.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.570
Hurry up and end this so he can rest.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:50.060
This is the least we can do for our rival who has made us suffer this much.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.460
Yes!

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:56.620
Bottom of the twelfth inning: leading off for Kaido Academy...

00:11:56.620 --> 00:12:00.400
Batting sixth: left fielder, Ishimatsu-kun.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.540
Play!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:11.700
All right!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.610
Batting seventh:

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:17.430
Pinch-hitting for Yaoita-kun, the batter is Miyake-kun.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:20.950
Play!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.360
<i>The loose pitches with no strength are going straight down the middle.</i>

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:25.960
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.940
<i>This is really bad, Shigeno!</i>

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.420
Ball!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.360
<i>You've done well.</i>

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.660
<i>You've done well coming this far, Shigeno.</i>

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:41.370
<i>I understand why you left us now, watching you.</i>

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.840
<i>You're a true competitor!</i>

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.610
Batting eighth:

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:54.770
Pinch-hitting for Izumi-kun, the batter is Kodama-kun.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.170
Hey.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.670
Dear.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:08.400
What are you doing here?

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.580
Ball!

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.950
Four balls!

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:18.370
I see.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:25.720
But the one that's having the hardest time is him.

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.550
What sort of parents are we if we don't see him off?

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:33.490
That's what I thought and I just couldn't keep working. 

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:37.910
Batting ninth: pitcher, Mayumura-kun.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.700
It's over.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.870
It sure was a long game.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:58.330
He should be content if Mayumura finishes this off.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:05.990
<i>Don't worry!</i>

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:08.670
<i>The heavens are completely on my side right now! {M: from ep 19} </i>

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.090
Play!

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.760
<i>D-Dad!</i>

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.440
<i>D-Dad!</i>

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>That's right, Dad.</i>

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:40.530
<i>I can't give up yet.</i>

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:46.290
<i>They started baseball for me,</i>

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:51.960
<i>and they lent me their strength up till now because of my selfish desire to defeat Kaido. </i>

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.260
<i>I have to repay that favor.</i>

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.500
<i>And the only way to do that is to...</i>

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:06.060
<i>win and let them stand on the grounds of Koshien!</i>

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.690
Strike!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.150
It's fast!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.110
The velocity of his pitches have returned at this stage!?

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.650
He's tough.

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:18.110
What a boy...

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:22.470
<i>Shigeno.</i>

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.750
<i>You're...</i>

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.620
<i>H-He's amazing!</i>

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.330
<i>This old man is amazing as expected!</i>

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.470
<i>I won't let you hit it no matter what!</i>

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.070
Foul!

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.550
You've got to be kidding me!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.020
His pitches should be weaker!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:57.480
There's no strength left in Goro-kun to hold Mayumura back.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.990
T-They're saved.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.080
Yeah...

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.450
But when he's totally captured the ball...

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:12.830
<i>He's a monster.</i>

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.670
Ball!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.750
Ball!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.010
The count is 2-2!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.430
<i>You knew that this would happen.</i>

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:35.400
<i>Maybe it would've been best to make him stop back then.</i>

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.630
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:41.620
<i>He'll hit it!</i>

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:44.320
<i>There's no place I can throw this!</i>

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.500
Ball!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.550
Shigeno-kun is finally cornered.

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.400
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:01.150
<i>I'm so pathetic!</i>

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.600
<i>So we end up finishing in the quarterfinals...</i>

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.580
<i>Who said something about Koshien!?</i>

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.560
<i>Who said something about repaying everyone!?</i>

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:22.520
Shigeno.

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:29.650
You said something about taking responsibility for dragging us this far because of your selfishness.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:37.790
But if you've misunderstood something, I'll say it clearly now.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:42.550
We didn't get dragged into this because of your selfishness!

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.000
That's right!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.630
We started baseball out of our own free will!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:50.980
I don't remember being forced into it as if it was my obligation!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.640
Or rather, I'm thankful to you.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.860
If you didn't invite us to join the baseball club,

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:06.070
we would have been stuck in the classroom.

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:09.490
Yeah.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:10.950
That's right.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:14.220
You guys...

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.420
Throw a pitch you won't regret later!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:28.890
Even if this may be our last pitch,
we will never forget your 184th pitch!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:50.960
The rain...

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:05.980
<i>This is definitely the moment when the goddess of victory smiles down on earth.</i>

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:07.840
Play!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.390
Let's go! Shigeno!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.630
Foul!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:35.830
Foul!

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.320
Foul!

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.000
That boy...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.500
To think he'd fight this much...

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.150
<i>Please, Dad.</i>

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.190
<i>If you're there...</i>

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:12.540
<i>Please protect Goro!</i>

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.130
Strike!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.200
Batter out!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.130
All right!

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.380
He did it!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:37.600
Amazing...

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.810
Nice, Shigeno!

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.250
<i>It's a shame.</i>

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.770
<i>It's a shame, Shigeno.</i>

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:53.470
<i>If you weren't an idiot that's going to burn out here, </i>

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:59.240
<i>we could have been the best of rivals in the pros, inspiring one another.</i>

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:02.710
Batting first: center fielder, Kusano-kun.

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:04.670
<i>What a guy!</i>

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:09.290
<i>We may not be over yet!</i>

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:11.670
<i>That's right.</i>

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:12.760
<i>It's not over yet!</i>

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:14.600
<i>Let's win!</i>

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.970
<i>Let's win and go to Koshien!</i>

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.100
<i>Right, Shigeno?</i>

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.200
B-Balk!

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.280
All right!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.640
It's the game-ending run home!

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:09.880
D-Doctor!

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.950
Staff! Get the stretcher!

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:36.270
Kaido sure was as strong as I expected.

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:41.190
It was fun.

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:44.820
Win at Koshien no matter what.

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:53.730
Goro-kun!

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.880
Come back!

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:59.700
Come back to the mound again when your foot is healed!

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:06.320
Of course.

00:24:41.090 --> 00:24:42.060
Graduation.

00:24:42.060 --> 00:24:43.180
And to the pros.

00:24:43.800 --> 00:24:45.840
Everyone starts walking towards their new future.

00:24:46.510 --> 00:24:52.410
A letter beckoning me from across the ocean arrives from that man while I was training for the pros.

00:24:53.180 --> 00:24:55.190
Next time, on Major:

00:24:55.190 --> 00:24:56.660
To the Stage of Dreams.
